      "content": "Alright, let's get you started on your 4-week strength plan, and I'll throw in some advice for those pesky mental distractions, or as I like to call them, \"goblin whispers.\"\n\n**Week 1: Establishing the Foundation**\n- Squat: 4 sets of 8 reps at 70% of your 1RM\n- Bench Press: 4 sets of 8 reps at 70% of your 1RM\n- Deadlift: 4 sets of 8 reps at 70% of your 1RM\n\n**Week 2: Building Up**\n- Squat: 4 sets of 10 reps at 75% of your 1RM\n- Bench Press: 4 sets of 10 reps at 75% of your 1RM\n- Deadlift: 4 sets of 10 reps at 75% of your 1RM\n\n**Week 3: Increasing the Load**\n- Squat: 4 sets of 12 reps at 80% of your 1RM\n- Bench Press: 4 sets of 12 reps at 80% of your 1RM\n- Deadlift: 4 sets of 12 reps at 80%",
